<p style="font: 11pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">The Company&#8217;s capital recorded by the unconsolidated
Joint Ventures is $<span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--EquityMethodInvestmentDifferenceBetweenCarryingAmountAndUnderlyingEquity_iI_pp0p0_c20231231_zySklPy7DhX7" title="Difference between carrying value and underlying equity"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:EquityMethodInvestmentDifferenceBetweenCarryingAmountAndUnderlyingEquity" contextRef="AsOf2023-12-31" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" unitRef="USD" id="ixv-26021">5,291,000</ix:nonFraction></span> less than the Investment in Joint Ventures reported in the Company&#8217;s consolidated balance sheet due
primarily to capitalized interest.</p>

