<p style="font: 11pt Courier New, Courier, Monospace; margin: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 11pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0; text-align: justify">The amount of consolidated retained earnings (accumulated
deficit) for these joint ventures&#160;was $<span id="xdx_90C_eus-gaap--RetainedEarningsUndistributedEarningsFromEquityMethodInvestees_iI_pp0p0_c20231231_zLBzwR32Ed4d" title="Retained earnings (accumulated deficit)">(<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:RetainedEarningsUndistributedEarningsFromEquityMethodInvestees" contextRef="AsOf2023-12-31" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" sign="-" unitRef="USD" id="ixv-26132">21,823,000</ix:nonFraction>)</span> and $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--RetainedEarningsUndistributedEarningsFromEquityMethodInvestees_iI_pp0p0_c20221231_zRMYViY7YCek" title="Retained earnings (accumulated deficit)">(<ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:RetainedEarningsUndistributedEarningsFromEquityMethodInvestees" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" scale="0" sign="-" unitRef="USD" id="ixv-26133">13,115,000</ix:nonFraction>)</span> as of December 31, 2023 and December 31, 2022, respectively.</p>

<p style="font: 11pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0"><b>&#160;</b></p>

